      "text": [
        " سَمِعْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ اَللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ يَقُولُ: «إِنْ كُنْتَ فِي أَرْضٍ مَخُوفَةٍ فَخَشِيتَ لِصّاً أَوْ سَبُعاً فَصَلِّ اَلْفَرِيضَةَ وَ أَنْتَ عَلَى دَابَّتِكَ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1342 - It was narrated from Abu Basir that He said:\nI heard Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) say,\n\"If you are in a place of danger and fear a thief or a wild beast, then perform the obligatory prayer while riding your mount.\""
        ]
      }
